BND-03: let an outfall's CONCEN inflow set the quality of its reverse flow

The input reference allows a CONCEN inflow without a FLOW inflow at an
outfall, so that a pollutant enters with reverse flow. addExternalInflows()
tried to do this by adding -oldNetInflow to the outfall's flow, but
node_getSystemOutflow() sets a supplying outfall's inflow to its outflow,
so oldNetInflow is 0 and nothing was added. When the outfall also had a FLOW
inflow the term did fire, but it replaced the FLOW inflow q by the reverse
flow b, and that mass was then mixed into q alone: the outfall's
concentration was b/q times the CONCEN value. Remove that term, and
instead make the outfall hold the CONCEN value as its quality: a supplying
outfall receives no flow, so findNodeQual() keeps that held value and the
reverse flow carries it into the network.

The reverse flow's mass is booked by BND-04, not here.

Requires: BND-04

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply BND-03_swmm530.patch

diff --git a/src/legacy/engine/routing.c b/src/legacy/engine/routing.c
index 1aef3c1..587be63 100644
--- a/src/legacy/engine/routing.c
+++ b/src/legacy/engine/routing.c
@@ -573,12 +573,6 @@ void addExternalInflows(DateTime currentDate)
             continue;
         }
 
-        // --- add on any inflow (i.e., reverse flow) through an outfall
-        if ( Node[j].type == OUTFALL && Node[j].oldNetInflow < 0.0 ) 
-        {
-            q = q - Node[j].oldNetInflow;
-        }
-
         // --- get pollutant mass inflows
         inflow = Node[j].extInflow;
         while ( inflow )
@@ -587,7 +581,13 @@ void addExternalInflows(DateTime currentDate)
             {
                 p = inflow->param;
                 w = inflow_getExtInflow(inflow, currentDate);
-                if ( inflow->type == CONCEN_INFLOW ) w *= q;
+                if ( inflow->type == CONCEN_INFLOW )
+                {
+                    // --- an outfall holds this concentration, so that any
+                    //     reverse flow into the network carries it
+                    if ( Node[j].type == OUTFALL ) Node[j].oldQual[p] = w;
+                    w *= q;
+                }
                 Node[j].newQual[p] += w;
                 massbal_addInflowQual(EXTERNAL_INFLOW, p, w);
             }
